+    zx2c4@thinkpad ~ $ gcc a.c -m64 && ./a.out
+    success
+    zx2c4@thinkpad ~ $ gcc a.c -m32 && ./a.out
+    success
+    
+    This doesn't solve y2038 problem, but timespec64 isn't yet a thing in
+    userspace.
+    
+    Signed-off-by: Jason A. Donenfeld <Jason@zx2c4.com>
